        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyuɔ̱th I-ca-yaa kɛ da̱k I-jëp kɛnɛ Kuc",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ruɔ̱n ëë jäk kuäär A-thi-ri-ya ni Thar-gon ɛ ni bo̱o̱th rɛ̈m in di̱i̱t mëë bi Ac-dod wä mak kä cuɛ jɛ ka̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ jɛn ruɔ̱n ɛmɔ, cu Kuoth Nhial ruac kɛ thok I-ca-yaa gat A-modh wëë i̱, “Wër woc bi̱i̱ cuaalä puɔ̱ɔ̱nydu, kä woc wa̱a̱ri ciökniku.” Kä cuɛ jɛ la̱t a jälɛ ni juutdä kä jälɛ kɛ pa̱a̱tkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Ce̱tnikɛ mɔ jäl ja̱ŋdä ni I-ca-yaa mɔ juutdä, kä jälɛ kɛ pa̱a̱tkɛ kɛ run diɔ̱k, bɛ la nyuuth kɛ kui̱ I-jëp kɛnɛ Kuc, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inɔ bi kuäär A-thi-ri-ya ji̱ I-jëp kɛnɛ ji̱ Kuc naŋ ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c. Bikɛ wä juutdä nikɛ pa̱a̱tkiɛn, ŋuɛ̈tni kɛ dɔŋ bikɛ ja̱l ni baaŋ a thil bieyni kɛ kui̱ po̱cä ji̱ I-jëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛy tin ŋa̱thkɛ ni ji̱ Kuc kä liakɛ rɔ̱ kɛ ji̱ I-jëp bikɛ ga̱a̱c kä bikɛ yi̱c kɛ tin ci tuɔɔk kä kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ ni̱ni tɔ̱tɔ̱ bi nɛy tin cieŋ jɔk yiëër wee i̱, ‘Nɛ̈nɛ min ci tuɔɔk kä nɛy tin ŋa̱thnɛ, nɛy tin la kɔn rɔ̱ a wä lua̱k kɛ, kä ba kɔn kän kä kuäär A-thi-ri-ya! Kä banɛ rɔ̱ kulɛ leny i̱di?’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
